OL,3,GNEWSADiabetes-related amputations down
OL,4,Aas cases rising
OL,5,
OL,6,FAwareness-raising is helping to reduce
OL,7,Famputations for diabetics despite rises
OL,8,Fin the number of people with the
OL,9,Fdisease, health bosses say.
OL,11,FThe number of diabetics in Cornwall and
OL,12,Fthe Isles of Scilly has risen by more
OL,13,Fthan 10,000 in the last 10 years.
OL,15,FHowever, according to the NHS, despite
OL,16,Fthe number of cases rising from 26,154
OL,17,Fin 2016 to 37,589 today, amputations
OL,18,Ffell from 134 to 104 per year during
OL,19,Fthe same time period.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
