OL,3,GNEWSADiabetes-related amputations down
OL,4,Aas cases rising
OL,5,
OL,6,FCornwall and Isles of Scilly NHS said
OL,7,Fpeople could to take simple steps to
OL,8,Fprevent later serious complications,
OL,9,Fand they had released a film to raise
OL,10,Fawareness of the new Happy Feet
OL,11,Fcampaign to further encourage diabetics
OL,12,Fto speak to a medical professional
OL,13,Fquickly.
